{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-async-threshold","title":"同步/异步判定与体量阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/async-job-model/sync-async-threshold","wordCount":2788,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"同步-异步判定与体量阈值\">同步/异步判定与体量阈值</h1><p>批量接口最容易被写错的一行代码，是把「行数」当成唯一的分流依据。真实系统里，100 行的批量改价可能因为要调用外部定价服务而耗时 30 秒，而 5 万行的批量打标可能因为只是一条 <code>UPDATE</code> 语句而在 200 毫秒内完成。分流必须基于<strong>预期执行时间与失败语义</strong>，行数只是一个输入变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>同步请求的契约是：响应返回时，操作要么已完成，要么已确定失败。异步任务的契约是：响应返回时，操作<strong>尚未开始或正在进行</strong>，调用方拿到的是一个句柄，后续通过它查询结果。HTTP 规范对这个句柄有明确描述——202 响应「表示请求已被接受处理，但处理尚未完成或可能尚未开始」，且因为无法再发回一个异步 HTTP 响应，响应内容应当「指向（或内嵌）一个能提供完成时间预估的状态监视器」（<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status/202\">MDN 202 Accepted</a>）。</p>\n<p>判定过程可以用三个维度同时衡量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[一次批量操作请求] --&gt; B{预期执行时间 &gt; 阈值?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C{允许部分成功?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| F[异步任务]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D{有不可回滚副作用?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E{调用方能解析逐行结果?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F&#10;  D --&gt;|否| G[同步返回]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G\">graph TD\n  A[一次批量操作请求] --&gt; B{预期执行时间 &gt; 阈值?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C{允许部分成功?}\n  B --&gt;|是| F[异步任务]\n  C --&gt;|否| D{有不可回滚副作用?}\n  C --&gt;|是| E{调用方能解析逐行结果?}\n  D --&gt;|是| F\n  D --&gt;|否| G[同步返回]\n  E --&gt;|否| F\n  E --&gt;|是| G</pre><p>三个维度的相对权重随业务变化，但顺序不应颠倒：执行时间决定「能不能同步」，失败语义决定「同步返回的结果有没有用」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定维度-为什么行数不够用\">判定维度：为什么行数不够用</h2><h3 id=\"预期执行时间的估算\">预期执行时间的估算</h3><p>估算批量操作的耗时，正确做法是把它拆成固定成本与可变成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total} \\approx T_{setup} + N \\cdot \\frac{T_{unit}}{P} + T_{commit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是行数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单行处理成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是有效并行度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{commit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提交与收尾成本。这个公式的价值在于它暴露了三个容易被忽略的项：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 让「大任务拆成多个小请求」不一定更快；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 的上限来自数据库连接数与下游限流，不是 CPU 核数；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{commit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在跨系统场景下可能相当可观。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须查实测分位数而非均值。如果单行操作要调用一个外部服务，其 P99 可能是 P50 的数十倍，用均值估算会让长尾任务大幅超时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"调用方对不确定性的容忍度\">调用方对不确定性的容忍度</h3><p>有些调用方<strong>必须</strong>同步拿到结果：收银台在结算前校验优惠券、下单时预占库存。这类调用即使偶尔慢，也不能返回「稍后告诉你」。另一些调用方天然可以等待：商家夜里提交的全店改价，第二天早上看报表即可。</p>\n<p>区分标准是<strong>下一步动作是否依赖这个结果</strong>。若调用方在拿到结果前无法做任何有意义的事，异步化的收益就只是把等待从连接里挪到了轮询里；只有在调用方拿到句柄后可以去做别的、或者由平台主动回调时，异步化才真正释放了价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"副作用与部分成功的可接受性\">副作用与部分成功的可接受性</h3><p>第三个维度最容易被漏掉。批量发货这种操作，每行都有不可回滚的外部副作用（调用物流商下单），失败行必须精确报告给商家处理，一个「全部失败」的粗粒度结果没有用。这类操作无论多快都应当异步化，因为调用方需要的是<strong>逐行结果</strong>，而逐行结果的体积本身就可能超过一个舒适的响应体。</p>\n<p>反过来，如果操作是幂等的、可整体重试的（例如把一批商品打上同一个标签），那么失败时调用方只需要重试整个请求即可，同步返回完全够用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作类型</th>\n<th>典型行数</th>\n<th>单行成本</th>\n<th>副作用</th>\n<th>推荐形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量打标</td>\n<td>1 万–50 万</td>\n<td>极低（单条 UPDATE）</td>\n<td>可重试</td>\n<td>同步或短异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量改价</td>\n<td>1 千–10 万</td>\n<td>低，但触发缓存失效</td>\n<td>可重试</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量发货</td>\n<td>100–5 万</td>\n<td>高（外部 API）</td>\n<td>不可回滚</td>\n<td>异步 + 逐行结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量导入商品</td>\n<td>1 千–100 万</td>\n<td>中（校验 + 写入）</td>\n<td>可重试</td>\n<td>异步 + 结果文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量导出订单</td>\n<td>不定</td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>异步 + 结果文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阈值如何标定\">阈值如何标定</h2><h3 id=\"从-sla-反推阈值\">从 SLA 反推阈值</h3><p>阈值不该拍脑袋定，而应当从平台自身的超时预算反推。设网关超时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{gw}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，安全系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（通常取 0.6–0.7），则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{threshold} = \\alpha \\cdot T_{gw}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的意义是留出降级空间：即使估算偏低、实际操作超过了阈值，同步路径仍有机会在网关超时前完成，而不是必然失败。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>取值来源</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>调整信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{gw}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 网关超时</td>\n<td>接入层配置，平台不可控</td>\n<td>30 s</td>\n<td>网关方变更时同步调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 安全系数</td>\n<td>估算误差的历史分布</td>\n<td>0.6–0.7</td>\n<td>降级率 &gt;1% 时下调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 单行成本</td>\n<td>生产 p99 实测</td>\n<td>随操作类型</td>\n<td>下游延迟劣化时重测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 有效并行度</td>\n<td>连接池与下游限流的最小值</td>\n<td>8–32</td>\n<td>加机器无效则说明在等下游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬性拒绝线</td>\n<td>单任务最大行数配额</td>\n<td>100 万</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../quota-governance/bulk-quota-concurrency-limit\">批量配额与并发上限</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若网关超时 30 秒，阈值约 18–21 秒。这个数量级与 Google 长期运行操作规范的经验值一致——该规范建议「可能耗时 10 秒以上」的方法应当返回操作句柄而非阻塞（<a href=\"https://google.aip.dev/151\">AIP-151</a>）。注意两者来源不同：18–21 秒是从本平台的网关预算反推的，10 秒是跨 API 的经验参考，取更保守者作为上限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不用行数阈值\">为什么不用行数阈值</h3><p>行数阈值的问题在于它是<strong>估算结果的替代品</strong>，而不是估算本身。一旦写下 <code>if (rows &gt; 10000) async()</code>，就等于承诺「所有操作的单行成本都相同」，而这是不成立的。更糟的是，行数阈值会让阈值本身成为一种隐式契约：商家发现 9999 行能同步返回，就会把大批量操作切成许多个 9999 行，绕过异步化的限流与配额——这正是平台不希望的请求形态。</p>\n<p>如果一定要保留一个静态上限，把它设成<strong>硬性拒绝线</strong>而不是分流线：超过某个行数直接要求走异步导入接口，而不是偷偷降级成同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步路径的降级协议\">同步路径的降级协议</h2><p>即使分流逻辑正确，仍会有操作在同步路径上超时——估算误差、下游抖动、突发负载。这时必须有一个确定的降级行为，否则调用方重试可能造成重复副作用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"提交时需要幂等键\">提交时需要幂等键</h3><p>同步批量接口必须接受一个幂等键。调用方在超时重试时带上同一个键，平台才能判断这是一次重试而非一次新操作。Stripe 的幂等实现把这个语义说得很直白：它保存「该幂等键的第一次请求所返回的状态码和响应体，无论成功还是失败」，后续同键请求返回同一结果（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests\">Stripe Idempotent requests</a>）。批量接口可以照此办理：第一次请求超时后，平台把操作转成后台任务并记下 <code>idempotency_key -&gt; job_id</code> 的映射；调用方用同一个键重试时，直接得到该任务句柄。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降级响应的形状\">降级响应的形状</h3><p>降级发生时，响应应当是 202 而不是 500：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 202 Accepted&#10;Content-Type: application/json&#10;Location: /v1/bulk-jobs/job_7f3c9a21&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;job_id&quot;: &quot;job_7f3c9a21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;PENDING&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;SYNC_TIMEOUT_DEGRADED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target_count&quot;: 42310,&#10;  &quot;status_url&quot;: &quot;/v1/bulk-jobs/job_7f3c9a21&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 202 Accepted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Location: /v1/bulk-jobs/job_7f3c9a21</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"job_id\": \"job_7f3c9a21\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"status\": \"PENDING\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"reason\": \"SYNC_TIMEOUT_DEGRADED\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"target_count\": 42310,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"status_url\": \"/v1/bulk-jobs/job_7f3c9a21\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键在于调用方<strong>不需要区分</strong>「本来就走异步」和「同步超时降级」——两者返回同一个结构，只多一个 <code>reason</code> 说明为何降级。这样调用方的处理逻辑只有一条路径，避免了两套代码。</p>\n<p>平台在这个时刻有一个必须做的动作：把已产生的部分结果<strong>丢弃并回滚</strong>，或者<strong>保留并转交</strong>给异步任务。两种都可行，但必须显式选择。保留转交要求同步路径从一开始就按行记录进度，成本较高；丢弃回滚更简单，代价是重试时前面已做的行要重做。对于幂等的操作，丢弃回滚是更划算的默认选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"调用方必须做的两件事\">调用方必须做的两件事</h3><p>平台侧能做的是提供降级，调用方侧必须配合两点，否则降级协议不成立：第一，重试必须带幂等键，且键在首次提交时生成、在重试期间保持不变；第二，收到 202 后必须转为轮询或等待回调，不能把 202 当成成功直接标记业务完成。第二点尤其在批量发货这类有外部副作用的场景下致命——把 202 当成功会导致商家以为已经发货，实际任务可能还在队列里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步与异步的接口形态对照\">同步与异步的接口形态对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>同步批量接口</th>\n<th>异步任务接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成功响应码</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>202</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应体</td>\n<td>逐行结果或聚合计数</td>\n<td>任务句柄 + 状态查询地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败粒度</td>\n<td>整体失败，或 207 式的逐项状态</td>\n<td>任务级终态 + 结果文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时处理</td>\n<td>降级为异步任务</td>\n<td>不适用（本身即异步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试语义</td>\n<td>依赖幂等键</td>\n<td>依赖任务幂等键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进度可见性</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>进度查询接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型行数</td>\n<td>数十至数千</td>\n<td>数千至百万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额消耗</td>\n<td>计入接口 QPS 配额</td>\n<td>计入任务数与行数配额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>207 Multi-Status 是同步路径上表达「多项独立操作各自成败」的标准手段，WebDAV 定义它「为多个资源返回状态信息」，响应体是一个 <code>multistatus</code> 元素，其中每个 <code>response</code> 元素携带自身的状态码（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4918.html\">RFC 4918</a>）。但它只在结果体积可控时有意义——几十万条明细用 207 表达会让响应体膨胀到无法处理，这时应当改用结果文件，参见 <a href=\"../status-result-callback/result-file-error-detail\">结果文件与逐行错误明细</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分流依据是<strong>预期执行时间 + 失败语义</strong>，行数只是估算执行时间的输入，不能单独作为阈值。</li>\n<li>执行时间估算用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total} \\approx T_{setup} + N \\cdot T_{unit}/P + T_{commit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须取分位数而非均值。</li>\n<li>当调用方需要逐行结果、或操作有不可回滚副作用时，即使很快也应异步化。</li>\n<li>阈值从网关超时反推，取安全系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span>；Google 的经验参考值是 10 秒。</li>\n<li>不要用行数阈值做分流线，否则会诱导调用方把大任务切碎以绕过限流；行数上限应当是硬性拒绝线。</li>\n<li>同步路径必须支持超时降级为异步任务，降级响应用 202 且结构与原生异步完全一致，靠幂等键保证重试不产生重复副作用。</li>\n<li>调用方的两项义务：重试带同一幂等键；收到 202 后不得视为业务完成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分流决策确定之后，接下来要定义任务对象本身——它的字段、状态与终态语义，见 <a href=\"job-schema-lifecycle\">任务 schema 与生命周期状态机</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"同步/异步判定与体量阈值","id":"同步-异步判定与体量阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"判定维度：为什么行数不够用","id":"判定维度-为什么行数不够用"},{"level":3,"text":"预期执行时间的估算","id":"预期执行时间的估算"},{"level":3,"text":"调用方对不确定性的容忍度","id":"调用方对不确定性的容忍度"},{"level":3,"text":"副作用与部分成功的可接受性","id":"副作用与部分成功的可接受性"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值如何标定","id":"阈值如何标定"},{"level":3,"text":"从 SLA 反推阈值","id":"从-sla-反推阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不用行数阈值","id":"为什么不用行数阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"同步路径的降级协议","id":"同步路径的降级协议"},{"level":3,"text":"提交时需要幂等键","id":"提交时需要幂等键"},{"level":3,"text":"降级响应的形状","id":"降级响应的形状"},{"level":3,"text":"调用方必须做的两件事","id":"调用方必须做的两件事"},{"level":2,"text":"同步与异步的接口形态对照","id":"同步与异步的接口形态对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"任务 schema 与生命周期状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/async-job-model/job-schema-lifecycle"}}